flowchart TD
    Candidate["Memory candidate"] --> Consent{"Memory enabled and permitted?"}
    Consent -->|No| Discard["Discard candidate"]
    Consent -->|Yes| Filter["Usefulness + sensitive-data filter"]
    Filter -->|Reject| Discard
    Filter -->|Accept| Provenance["Attach source, timestamp, confidence"]
    Provenance --> Persist["Persist with retention policy"]
    Persist --> Retrieve["Retrieve by relevance and policy"]
    Retrieve --> Context["Add as untrusted context with provenance"]
    Persist --> Expiry["Expiry / deletion worker"]
    Expiry --> Delete["Delete or anonymize per policy"]
